            "line": 719,
            "text": "theorem physicalSigma_eq_negative_primitive (P : Patch) (e : ℕ) {q : E → ℝ}\n    (hq : ContDiff ℝ ∞ q) (hpos : ∀ p, 0 < q p) {F : ℝ × E → ℝ}\n    (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F) (hs : PhysicalSupport P q F) (z : ℝ × E) :\n    physicalSigma P e q F z =\n      -(∫ r in (0 : ℝ)..z.1, r ^ e * physicalAdjusted P e q F (r, z.2)) / z.1 ^ e"
